                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "21e5310d-2c99-3022-a35c-7c99d01cb235",
                        "entry_id": "b7f8a625-ef4a-32e2-a3dd-ef8c4d673fa5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "непонятный, неясный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f4ff5273-f4ae-4489-98b8-d3200cdd12a3",
                        "source_entry_id": "b7f8a625-ef4a-32e2-a3dd-ef8c4d673fa5",
                        "source_sense_id": "21e5310d-2c99-3022-a35c-7c99d01cb235",
                        "target_lang_word": "unintelligible",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unintelligible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d9386c3-37dd-3321-b23c-bcf859e65e02",
                                        "entry_id": "11bd7bc4-b766-390d-b734-8c9b0d361274",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not intelligible; unable to be understood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "334963e1-c315-4a9c-b657-7a3ca9bfa2ce",
                                                "sense_id": "7d9386c3-37dd-3321-b23c-bcf859e65e02",
                                                "text": "And indeed, my lord, there are so many passages in your writing in this controversy with me, which for their construction, as well as otherwise, are so unintelligible to me, that if I should be so unmannerly as to measure your understanding by mine, I should not know what to think of them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d2b3fb0-b6cb-4aef-b543-0d6f6f2ec04e",
                                                "sense_id": "7d9386c3-37dd-3321-b23c-bcf859e65e02",
                                                "text": "They have ſwallowed and digeſted all the Fathers, the Codes, Provincials, Decretals, Pandects, Councils, Canons ; are Maſters of all the Schoolmen, not to fill their Heads and ſtuff their Writings with Quiddities and Quoddities, and far-fetched unintelligible Diſtinctions, but to be able to reaſon cloſely, to argue ſolidly, to rebuke, to confute, to reply, to rejoind, to ſyllogize, to criticize, to apologize, to advertize, to ſermonize, to decypherize, to――"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaf7bb16-b92f-499a-991b-9b51e2f3718d",
                                                "sense_id": "7d9386c3-37dd-3321-b23c-bcf859e65e02",
                                                "text": "The curious feature of the art was that \"horse-whisperers\" actually talked to the animal, usually from mouth to ear, in an unintelligible tongue; which, however, the horses appeared to understand."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f3c164e-cf8c-47cb-880f-0cfaccd37b7f",
                                                "sense_id": "7d9386c3-37dd-3321-b23c-bcf859e65e02",
                                                "text": "Unintelligible announcements on station loudspeakers are both irritating and confusing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90daa00e-23ad-4e72-a1d6-5e5d955717ec",
                                                "sense_id": "7d9386c3-37dd-3321-b23c-bcf859e65e02",
                                                "text": "Lately, a study was made of oracle-bone inscriptions excavated in 1899 in the T'ang-yin county, 湯陰縣, of Honan Province and amounting to several thousand pieces, having unintelligible inscriptions whose dates nobody could determine.",
                                                "translation": "清代學術概論",
                                                "english": "清代學術概論"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e64951d6-7715-4f86-8987-c22c5d02cabd",
                        "source_entry_id": "b7f8a625-ef4a-32e2-a3dd-ef8c4d673fa5",
                        "source_sense_id": "21e5310d-2c99-3022-a35c-7c99d01cb235",
                        "target_lang_word": "incomprehensible",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incomprehensible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fc3dea2-c809-3d6c-a897-70288fd3a5c9",
                                        "entry_id": "52ea041a-a7aa-341f-81a5-01ff3c1d406b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impossible or very difficult to understand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2937a1d-1fd4-4f9c-a87a-31f40d7cfaf9",
                                                "sense_id": "7fc3dea2-c809-3d6c-a897-70288fd3a5c9",
                                                "text": "But this inference, which is supported by the opening of Book I, renders incomprehensible the note \"and I have finished writing this,\" which is included within the dream."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7c4fb4e-ca2a-4162-9ba7-1770e9ff88e1",
                                                "sense_id": "7fc3dea2-c809-3d6c-a897-70288fd3a5c9",
                                                "text": "In the empty immensity of earth, sky, and water, there she was, incomprehensible, firing into a continent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "996672d0-b519-4456-998f-c9a0e5aea3bd",
                                                "sense_id": "7fc3dea2-c809-3d6c-a897-70288fd3a5c9",
                                                "text": "He shook his head. 'It's not only undefined, it's incomprehensible. Even the QL is befuddled by it and can't give me straight answers.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d9a9e3a-41d8-43d2-9a83-16002bd6aa84",
                                                "sense_id": "7fc3dea2-c809-3d6c-a897-70288fd3a5c9",
                                                "text": "Trump’s grotesque and incomprehensible fondness for Putin makes the details of any deal highly dangerous for Europe and the NATO alliance, founded to confront Russia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47ddc3c4-1914-3a90-a009-16541f4dfb3d",
                                        "entry_id": "52ea041a-a7aa-341f-81a5-01ff3c1d406b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Which cannot be contained; boundless, infinite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c1e8a1b-80de-41ff-ad05-240bcdd3d443",
                                                "sense_id": "47ddc3c4-1914-3a90-a009-16541f4dfb3d",
                                                "text": "Prayer to God the Father: It is fitting and right to sing to You, to bless You, to praise You, to give thanks to You, to worship You in every place of your dominion: for You are God, beyond description, beyond understanding, invisible, incomprehensible, always existing, always the same; You and your only-begotten Son and your Holy Spirit"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "incomprehensible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24a1cd17-d498-3694-aa83-856f1fa4e834",
                                        "entry_id": "7a770504-68b3-3514-891a-6085d0cc6d0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that is beyond understanding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
